[{"h": 0.0265552322098494, "w": 0.060822898017035595, "x": 0.11091234323954423, "y": 0.060697674445220645, "text": "7.4"}, {"y": 0.03643649810238978, "h": 0.018173515288838354, "x": 0.22355681491364748, "w": 0.14501517401801217, "text": "READING"}, {"text": "Travel problems • adjectives", "w": 0.20930231730143228, "x": 0.22182469284004103, "h": 0.011567983463783082, "y": 0.07694945835126643}, {"h": 0.0093179075382246, "y": 0.09207796479395257, "text": "• tourism", "x": 0.21997948935655165, "w": 0.071668930053711}, {"y": 0.0531104652200979, "x": 0.5313059039084228, "w": 0.010733451843261688, "h": 0.008851743820341951, "text": "1"}, {"w": 0.32200358072916657, "y": 0.05300090235659183, "text": "Read the text and match headings A-F with", "x": 0.5456171667016065, "h": 0.011490376499155346}, {"y": 0.06702034909842687, "x": 0.5527728088668806, "w": 0.318425767686632, "text": "paragraphs 1-5. There is one extra heading.", "h": 0.012677304366004975}, {"w": 0.14132378472222218, "x": 0.5545617227775294, "text": "A Can we join you?", "y": 0.08205324885233356, "h": 0.012955776173285189}, {"w": 0.18425759209526904, "h": 0.01138537906137181, "x": 0.5545617232502188, "text": "B You haven't got a ticket", "y": 0.09736462084579255}, {"text": "C An unexpected stopover", "x": 0.5527728086890867, "y": 0.11110559564884775, "h": 0.011554287852793362, "w": 0.19320214165581595}, {"text": "D We've arrived - but in the wrong country", "y": 0.12335335299438903, "w": 0.28842013888888884, "h": 0.014027336891807844, "x": 0.5526173251359978}, {"w": 0.010733451843261688, "y": 0.13909883727119282, "h": 0.007587208988864391, "text": "E", "x": 0.5527728088726447}, {"w": 0.18067977905273436, "h": 0.012677304366005072, "text": "Right name, wrong place", "y": 0.1378023463248123, "x": 0.5652951705511522}, {"x": 0.5527728088726447, "w": 0.010733451843261688, "text": "F", "y": 0.15174418611871712, "h": 0.008851743820341951}, {"h": 0.01275491095622089, "text": "You haven't gone far enough!", "x": 0.5635062640170446, "y": 0.15174418630772923, "w": 0.21288013034396702}, {"h": 0.0075872089888644875, "x": 0.10375670871577687, "text": "000", "w": 0.03041144900851779, "y": 0.17071220940847473}, {"y": 0.1908032499269379, "w": 0.787119886610243, "x": 0.105545600240684, "h": 0.0722382671480144, "text": "Travel lt 1"}, {"h": 0.04425872134818059, "y": 0.2756686044921047, "x": 0.10733452213463049, "text": "PROBLEMS", "w": 0.37388193766276046}, {"y": 0.2781976742788432, "h": 0.013909883895075253, "x": 0.5116279084088805, "text": "Travelling should be an exciting, relaxing, pleasant", "w": 0.37567084418402785}, {"y": 0.2920938630267379, "h": 0.015311371841155259, "x": 0.5116279164467702, "w": 0.3685151841905382, "text": "activity but sometimes, it is none of these things."}, {"text": "Here are some true travel horror stories.", "x": 0.5114286508670329, "w": 0.2956319512261285, "h": 0.01718912363913091, "y": 0.30535862007143566}, {"text": "A few years ago, a couple from England booked a", "x": 0.13953488859528937, "w": 0.31127010769314234, "h": 0.014133574007220224, "y": 0.3553023462030847}, {"w": 0.3202146742078994, "h": 0.011572547918622745, "x": 0.5491949849890737, "y": 0.35786337251779926, "text": "For sure, the Eurostar train from London to Paris or"}, {"h": 0.01266817395867856, "x": 0.10733452044794509, "y": 0.3705087212275797, "text": "bargain flight to the Caribbean online. It was from the local", "w": 0.37388193766276046}, {"text": "Brussels is a nice way to travel? Not always. In December", "y": 0.3717732559171043, "h": 0.01264534831477405, "w": 0.3649373711480035, "x": 0.5116279109823489}, {"y": 0.3855324907277105, "x": 0.10733453465937928, "text": "airport in Birmingham to the island of Trinidad. At the airport,", "w": 0.3846153767903646, "h": 0.012955776173285189}, {"h": 0.012718390075738675, "w": 0.37388193766276046, "text": "2009, several trains stopped in the tunnel. One family said", "x": 0.5098389985061271, "y": 0.38694767461659546}, {"h": 0.013909883895075349, "text": "there was no information about the flight on any of the", "x": 0.10554561369567286, "y": 0.39959302299486776, "w": 0.34883721245659716}, {"text": "that there were no lights, no air conditioning, no food and", "y": 0.4020216608179787, "h": 0.014133574007220224, "x": 0.5098390106775396, "w": 0.3685151841905382}, {"w": 0.38461537679036456, "h": 0.012955776173285189, "x": 0.10554561636778746, "text": "departure boards, so they went to ask at the information desk.", "y": 0.4145848375612045}, {"x": 0.5116279090349986, "y": 0.417296511799776, "text": "no water on their train. After several hours, they got off and", "w": 0.37567084418402774, "h": 0.011421899567442204}, {"text": "That's when they discovered why the flight was so cheap.", "w": 0.3631484646267361, "x": 0.10554562911328655, "y": 0.42989620910604165, "h": 0.014133574007220224}, {"x": 0.5098390075551988, "y": 0.43107400716663674, "text": "walked through the tunnel to find another train which was", "w": 0.372092997233073, "h": 0.012955776173285189}, {"text": "It was from Birmingham, Alabama in the USA, which is much", "h": 0.012654478722100659, "x": 0.10554562429116231, "w": 0.38461537679036456, "y": 0.44511627928883385}, {"h": 0.012727520483065188, "y": 0.4475631769807173, "x": 0.5080500850945797, "text": "warmer. Fortunately, no-one told them they had the wrong", "w": 0.37745975070529514}, {"x": 0.10554563007548318, "y": 0.4601263537255076, "text": "closer to the Caribbean than Birmingham, UK.", "w": 0.28801428900824655, "h": 0.012955776173285189}, {"w": 0.043028377956814134, "x": 0.5080028055642326, "text": "ticket.", "h": 0.011560096103792194, "y": 0.4614655913411038}, {"y": 0.48178779111695885, "text": "5", "x": 0.5205724505764134, "w": 0.025044723086886878, "h": 0.012645348314774242}, {"x": 0.14311271619745652, "text": "The moment you are up in the air, you can relax -", "y": 0.4982084839334812, "w": 0.3148479207356771, "h": 0.011399073923537888}, {"w": 0.32737030029296876, "h": 0.012750346126969504, "text": "Finally, a story about ferry travel. During a bad storm", "x": 0.5456171781629967, "y": 0.4993862814766385}, {"x": 0.10375670818891627, "y": 0.5119494584491427, "text": "yes? Not always. On a flight from Newark to Denver, one", "w": 0.35599283854166663, "h": 0.014133574007220224}, {"y": 0.514665697998863, "text": "one winter, the ferry from Portsmouth to Bilbao spent 36", "x": 0.5080500893904667, "h": 0.012645348314774147, "w": 0.35599283854166663}, {"y": 0.5270203513215951, "h": 0.01426819902895161, "x": 0.10368015831032949, "w": 0.35437784830729163, "text": "passenger decided to relax and tried to use her reclining"}, {"h": 0.012732085312316574, "text": "hours at sea. Eventually, it came into a harbour - in Brest,", "w": 0.3667262776692708, "x": 0.5080501017097039, "y": 0.5298401165041577}, {"x": 0.10375670939278034, "h": 0.012649913892849175, "w": 0.37567084418402774, "text": "seat. Unfortunately, the man in the seat behind her wanted", "y": 0.5424854653233022}, {"x": 0.508050093469755, "w": 0.3846153767903646, "y": 0.5437500000868011, "h": 0.013909883895075253, "text": "northern France. Unfortunately, it was also Christmas Eve and"}, {"text": "to work on his laptop and he used a special gadget called", "x": 0.10196780360310034, "h": 0.014133574007220224, "y": 0.557490974483831, "w": 0.3649373711480035}, {"y": 0.5601889537495895, "text": "there were no ferries back to the UK until after the holidays.", "x": 0.5062611859663251, "w": 0.37924865722656254, "h": 0.012645348314774147}, {"text": "a 'knee defender' to stop the seat from moving down. The", "w": 0.36529724121093754, "h": 0.016581087783785937, "x": 0.10181072432895234, "y": 0.5708467527931431}, {"text": "Passengers were left in Brest, 1000 km from Bilbao. Their", "x": 0.5062611911064292, "y": 0.5739801443795954, "w": 0.3631484646267361, "h": 0.012955776173285189}, {"text": "woman asked him to remove it. He refused. She threw a cup", "x": 0.10544301080213396, "y": 0.5863984834695466, "h": 0.013062622831186319, "w": 0.3759134589301215}, {"text": "only choices were to find a local hotel, rent a car and drive", "x": 0.5062611971977643, "y": 0.5892732560435577, "h": 0.012645348314774242, "w": 0.3703040907118056}, {"x": 0.10196779897064964, "w": 0.3846153767903646, "y": 0.6018546930365787, "h": 0.014133574007220224, "text": "of water over him. The plane stopped in Chicago, left the two"}, {"x": 0.5062611842838269, "w": 0.35241502549913195, "y": 0.6044476743209943, "h": 0.013909883895075253, "text": "all night or try to get to an airport and a very expensive,"}, {"h": 0.01265904430017569, "y": 0.6183438624659323, "w": 0.27370303683810765, "x": 0.10196779905858484, "text": "passengers there and continued its journey."}, {"text": "last-minute flight. Happy Christmas!", "y": 0.6195216609660508, "w": 0.22898032294379345, "h": 0.012745780548894378, "x": 0.5062611821178469}, {"y": 0.6436482560641879, "w": 0.1466905212402344, "h": 0.015174417977728975, "text": "DEPARTURES", "x": 0.5474060819782728}, {"y": 0.6548555955114109, "text": "If travelling by plane is too stressful, why not take", "h": 0.014133574007220224, "w": 0.314847920735677, "x": 0.13774598216346742}, {"x": 0.10196780665756096, "y": 0.6713447655757802, "text": "the train? A man from Darlington, in England, read that it", "w": 0.3577817450629341, "h": 0.012955776173285189}, {"w": 0.030411449008517777, "x": 0.5152057242077268, "y": 0.6689389537732182, "text": "TIME", "h": 0.010116278651819317}, {"h": 0.010116278651819317, "text": "DESTINATION", "x": 0.5688729915536078, "w": 0.08586761474609372, "y": 0.6702034884862269}, {"x": 0.6743664737352661, "y": 0.6700825521046588, "h": 0.010358151700952832, "w": 0.046615888807508665, "text": "FLIGHT"}, {"w": 0.10375670539008253, "y": 0.6701669675741312, "x": 0.7513416841564794, "text": "GATE REMARKS", "h": 0.010207581227436872}, {"y": 0.6847179128624198, "h": 0.014804762657798958, "text": "was cheaper to buy a ticket to Durham than Darlington.", "x": 0.10184989574455143, "w": 0.35267198350694445}, {"h": 0.010175297940250733, "w": 0.0447493998209636, "x": 0.5151923834820377, "text": "1239", "y": 0.6891420020249661}, {"w": 0.05729547288682724, "text": "LONDON", "h": 0.009015856021578159, "x": 0.5706367007667296, "y": 0.6903539904483865}, {"text": "BA 903", "x": 0.6761865709647766, "h": 0.007731464257739503, "y": 0.69162845378246, "w": 0.051920238071017866}, {"x": 0.7513416822325258, "h": 0.008851743820341951, "y": 0.6917005817257301, "w": 0.01967799504597978, "text": "31"}, {"y": 0.6917005815149744, "x": 0.7960644031150067, "text": "CANCELLED", "h": 0.008851743820341854, "w": 0.07692307366265183}, {"y": 0.7003971117389409, "w": 0.3738819376627604, "h": 0.014133574007220224, "x": 0.10017889071692025, "text": "Strangely, Durham was farther away. He thought it was OK."}, {"x": 0.5152057243194239, "w": 0.04293381161159937, "text": "12: 57", "h": 0.008851743820341951, "y": 0.7030813954684628}, {"w": 0.05747308519151473, "x": 0.5687589856271554, "y": 0.7027491547187307, "text": "SYDNEY", "h": 0.010780760088552227}, {"h": 0.0075872089888644875, "text": "0F5723", "y": 0.70434593043144, "w": 0.060822898017035665, "x": 0.6672629685824184}, {"y": 0.7043459303751752, "w": 0.01967799716525609, "h": 0.008851743820341951, "x": 0.7513416811132575, "text": "27"}, {"h": 0.010116278651819414, "w": 0.08050089518229164, "text": "CANCELLED", "y": 0.7043459305047588, "x": 0.7924865818140421}, {"w": 0.3452593994140625, "h": 0.012663609129427173, "x": 0.10017888993220544, "text": "so, he bought a ticket and got off one stop early. When", "y": 0.7157084835904599}, {"h": 0.008851743820341951, "x": 0.5152057255174122, "text": "13.08", "y": 0.715726744258252, "w": 0.04293380737304686}, {"text": "TORONTO", "w": 0.07879014756944447, "y": 0.7155902738794058, "x": 0.5688339075214985, "h": 0.011653754478757536}, {"text": "AC5984", "y": 0.7168604411870745, "x": 0.6743697843146502, "w": 0.053764902750651045, "h": 0.010377955092419774}, {"w": 0.021466905805799685, "h": 0.